    <tags>api security pentest reverse-engineering android apk proxy har openapi foss</tags>
    <summary>Open-source security workbench that recovers an app's API.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[APIaxess is an open-source security workbench that reverse-engineers an app's API from its APK, its live traffic, and HAR files, and fuses the evidence into an OpenAPI document, a Postman collection, and a Python SDK.

It ships as a native desktop app with everything it needs bundled — a private Chromium, a trimmed Java runtime, apktool, jadx, and ffuf — and runs entirely on your machine.

This package installs the official per-user MSI from the GitHub release after verifying its SHA-256. The release is unsigned; its checksums are published with every release.
]]></description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
